    {
      "id": "claim_34eeb5e8e3344e26a1e37281f9952010",
      "statement": "ModelRequest provides an immutable override() method allowing middleware to create new requests with modified fields: model, system_message, messages, tools, tool_choice, response_format, model_settings, and state. This enables middleware to customize the model call without mutations, preserving request immutability.",
