      "id": "claim_7ebac9e8512d469c8aa9db85def4ab44",
      "statement": "Middleware state schemas are merged with the agent's base state in order: middleware[0].state_schema, middleware[1].state_schema, ..., then the agent's state_schema parameter (if provided). Later schemas override earlier ones on field conflicts. The agent's explicit state_schema always wins, allowing users to override middleware annotations.",
