      "id": "claim_fd923b1f76ec4b6b9e5c55d90b425e02",
      "statement": "If middleware adds tools via wrap_model_call but doesn't handle their execution (no wrap_tool_call), the agent raises ValueError with DYNAMIC_TOOL_ERROR_TEMPLATE. This prevents silent tool call failures. Solutions include registering tools upfront, implementing wrap_tool_call, or using dict-based provider tools.",
